Matt 23:1 , Christ admonishes the people to follow the good doctrine, not the evil examples, of the Scribes and Pharisees;
Matt 23:5 , His disciples must beware of their ambition;
Matt 23:13 , He denounces eight woes against their hypocrisy and blindness
Matt 23:34 . and prophesies of the destruction of Jerusalem.
